you covet [the hope, O believers], that they would believe for you while a party of them used to hear the words of Allāh and then distort it [i.e., the Torah] after they had understood it while they were knowing?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أَفَتَطْمَعُونَ", "translit": "َnwُʿعَmْṭَtَfَaʾ", "root": "طمع"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَن", "translit": "nَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "يُؤْمِنُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnِmْwʾُy", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَقَدْ", "translit": "ْdَqَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "كَانَ", "translit": "َnāَk", "root": "كون"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فَرِيقٌ", "translit": "ٌqyِrَf", "root": "فرق"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مِّنْهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhْnِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "يَسْمَعُونَ", "translit": "َnwُʿعَmْsَy", "root": "سمع"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "كَلَٰمَ", "translit": "َmَٰlَk", "root": "كلم"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "يُحَرِّفُونَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَnwُfِّrَḥُy", "root": "حرف"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "مِنۢ", "translit": "ۢnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "بَعْدِ", "translit": "ِdْʿعَb", "root": "بعد"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "عَقَلُوهُ", "translit": "ُhwُlَqَʿع", "root": "عقل"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "وَهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "يَعْلَمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmَlْʿعَy", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 76, "text": "وَإِذَا لَقُوا۟ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ قَالُوٓا۟ ءَامَنَّا وَإِذَا خَلَا بَعْضُهُمْ إِلَىٰ بَعْضٍ قَالُوٓا۟ أَتُحَدِّثُونَهُم بِمَا فَتَحَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْكُمْ لِيُحَآجُّوكُم بِهِۦ عِندَ رَبِّكُمْۚ أَفَلَا تَعْقِلُونَ ", "translation": "And when they meet those who believe, they say, \"We have believed\"; but when they are alone with one another, they say, \"Do you talk to them about what Allāh has revealed to you so they can argue with you about it before your Lord?\" Then will you not reason?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَقُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُqَl", "root": "لقي"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "قَالُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ءَامَنَّا", "translit": "āَّnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَإِذَا", "translit": "āَhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "خَلَا", "translit": "āَlَhk", "root": "خلو"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "بَعْضُهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhُḍْʿعَb", "root": "بعض"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "إِلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "بَعْضٍ", "translit": "ٍḍْʿعَb", "root": "بعض"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "قَالُوٓا۟", "translit": "۟āٓwُlāَq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "أَتُحَدِّثُونَهُم", "translit": "mُhَnwُhtِّdَḥُtَaʾ", "root": "حدث"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "بِمَا", "translit": "āَmِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "فَتَحَ", "translit": "َḥَtَf", "root": "فتح"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "عَلَيْكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "لِيُحَآجُّوكُم", "translit": "mُkwُّjgٓāَḥُyِl", "root": "حجج"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "بِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "عِندَ", "translit": "َdnِʿع", "root": "عند"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "رَبِّكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkِّbَr", "root": "ربب"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "أَفَلَا", "translit": "āَlَfَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "تَعْقِلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlِqْʿعَt", "root": "عقل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 77, "text": "أَوَلَا يَعْلَمُونَ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَعْلَمُ مَا يُسِرُّونَ وَمَا يُعْلِنُونَ ", "translation": "But do they not know that Allāh knows what they conceal and what they declare?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "أَوَلَا", "translit": "āَlَwَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَعْلَمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmَlْʿعَy", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَنَّ", "translit": "َّnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يَعْلَمُ", "translit": "ُmَlْʿعَy", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "يُسِرُّونَ", "translit": "َnwُّrِsُy", "root": "سرر"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "يُعْلِنُونَ", "translit": "َnwُnِlْʿعُy", "root": "علن"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 78, "text": "وَمِنْهُمْ أُمِّيُّونَ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ ٱلْكِتَٰبَ إِلَّآ أَمَانِىَّ وَإِنْ هُمْ إِلَّا يَظُنُّونَ ", "translation": "And among them are unlettered ones who do not know the Scripture except [indulgement in] wishful thinking, but they are only assuming.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمِنْهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhْnِmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أُمِّيُّونَ", "translit": "َnwُّyِّmُaʾ", "root": "امم"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "يَعْلَمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmَlْʿعَy", "root": "علم"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبَ", "translit": "َbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "إِلَّآ", "translit": "ٓāَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "أَمَانِىَّ", "translit": "َّàِnāَmَaʾ", "root": "مني"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "وَإِنْ", "translit": "ْnِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "هُمْ", "translit": "ْmُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "يَظُنُّونَ", "translit": "َnwُّnُẓَy", "root": "ظنن"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 79, "text": "فَوَيْلٌ لِّلَّذِينَ يَكْتُبُونَ ٱلْكِتَٰبَ بِأَيْدِيهِمْ ثُمَّ يَقُولُونَ هَٰذَا مِنْ عِندِ ٱللَّهِ لِيَشْتَرُوا۟ بِهِۦ ثَمَنًا قَلِيلًاۖ فَوَيْلٌ لَّهُم مِّمَّا كَتَبَتْ أَيْدِيهِمْ وَوَيْلٌ لَّهُم مِّمَّا يَكْسِبُونَ ", "translation": "So woe[1] to those who write the \"scripture\" with their own hands, then say, \"This is from Allāh,\" in order to exchange it for a small price. Woe to them for what their hands have written and woe to them for what they earn.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَوَيْلٌ", "translit": "ٌlْyَwَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لِّلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlِّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "يَكْتُبُونَ", "translit": "َnwُbُtْkَy", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبَ", "translit": "َbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "بِأَيْدِيهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhyِdْyَaʾِb", "root": "يدي"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "يَقُولُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlwُqَy", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "هَٰذَا", "translit": "āَhdَٰh", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "مِنْ", "translit": "ْnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "عِندِ", "translit": "ِdnِʿع", "root": "عند"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "لِيَشْتَرُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُrَtْhsَyِl", "root": "شري"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "بِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "ثَمَنًا", "translit": "āًnَmَht", "root": "ثمن"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "قَلِيلًا", "translit": "āًlyِlَq", "root": "قلل"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "فَوَيْلٌ", "translit": "ٌlْyَwَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "لَّهُم", "translit": "mُhَّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "مِّمَّا", "translit": "āَّmِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "كَتَبَتْ", "translit": "ْtَbَtَk", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "أَيْدِيهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhyِdْyَaʾ", "root": "يدي"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "وَوَيْلٌ", "translit": "ٌlْyَwَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "لَّهُم", "translit": "mُhَّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "مِّمَّا", "translit": "āَّmِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "يَكْسِبُونَ", "translit": "َnwُbِsْkَy", "root": "كسب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 80, "text": "وَقَالُوا۟ لَن تَمَسَّنَا ٱلنَّارُ إِلَّآ أَيَّامًا مَّعْدُودَةًۚ قُلْ أَتَّخَذْتُمْ عِندَ ٱللَّهِ عَهْدًا فَلَن يُخْلِفَ ٱللَّهُ عَهْدَهُۥٓۖ أَمْ تَقُولُونَ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ مَا لَا تَعْلَمُونَ ", "translation": "And they say, \"Never will the Fire touch us, except for [a few] numbered days.\" Say, \"Have you taken a covenant with Allāh? For Allāh will never break His covenant. Or do you say about Allāh that which you do not know?\"", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَقَالُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlāَqَw", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَن", "translit": "nَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "تَمَسَّنَا", "translit": "āَnَّsَmَt", "root": "مسس"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلنَّارُ", "translit": "ُrāَّnlٱ", "root": "نور"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِلَّآ", "translit": "ٓāَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "أَيَّامًا", "translit": "āًmāَّyَaʾ", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "مَّعْدُودَةً", "translit": "ًẗَdwُdْʿعَّm", "root": "عدد"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "قُلْ", "translit": "ْlُq", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "أَتَّخَذْتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtْhdَhkَّtَaʾ", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "عِندَ", "translit": "َdnِʿع", "root": "عند"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "عَهْدًا", "translit": "āًdْhَʿع", "root": "عهد"}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "فَلَن", "translit": "nَlَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "يُخْلِفَ", "translit": "َfِlْhkُy", "root": "خلف"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "ٱللَّهُ", "translit": "ُhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "عَهْدَهُۥٓ", "translit": "ٓۥُhَdْhَʿع", "root": "عهد"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "أَمْ", "translit": "ْmَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "تَقُولُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlwُqَt", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "عَلَى", "translit": "àَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "ٱللَّهِ", "translit": "ِhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "تَعْلَمُونَ", "translit": "َnwُmَlْʿعَt", "root": "علم"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 81, "text": "بَلَىٰ مَن كَسَبَ سَيِّئَةً وَأَحَٰطَتْ بِهِۦ خَطِيٓـَٔتُهُۥ فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ أَصْحَٰبُ ٱلنَّارِۖ هُمْ فِيهَا خَٰلِدُونَ ", "translation": "Yes, [on the contrary], whoever earns evil and his sin has encompassed him - those are the companions of the Fire; they will abide therein eternally.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "بَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَb", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مَن", "translit": "nَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "كَسَبَ", "translit": "َbَsَk", "root": "كسب"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "سَيِّئَةً", "translit": "ًẗَyʾِّyَs", "root": "سوا"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَأَحَٰطَتْ", "translit": "ْtَṭَٰḥَaʾَw", "root": "حوط"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "بِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِb", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "خَطِيٓـَٔتُهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhُtَٔـٓyِṭَhk", "root": "خطا"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ", "translit": "َkِyʾَٰٓl۟wُaʾَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "أَصْحَٰبُ", "translit": "ُbَٰḥْṣَaʾ", "root": "صحب"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "ٱلنَّارِ", "translit": "ِrāَّnlٱ", "root": "نور"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "هُمْ", "translit": "ْmُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "فِيهَا", "translit": "āَhyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "خَٰلِدُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdِlَٰhk", "root": "خلد"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 82, "text": "وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ أَصْحَٰبُ ٱلْجَنَّةِۖ هُمْ فِيهَا خَٰلِدُونَ ", "translation": "But they who believe and do righteous deeds - those are the companions of Paradise; they will abide therein eternally.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "translit": "َnyِhdَّlٱَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُnَmāَء", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "وَعَمِلُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlِmَʿعَw", "root": "عمل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ", "translit": "ِtَٰḥِlَّٰṣlٱ", "root": "صلح"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ", "translit": "َkِyʾَٰٓl۟wُaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "أَصْحَٰبُ", "translit": "ُbَٰḥْṣَaʾ", "root": "صحب"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "ٱلْجَنَّةِ", "translit": "ِẗَّnَjgْlٱ", "root": "جنن"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "هُمْ", "translit": "ْmُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "فِيهَا", "translit": "āَhyِf", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "خَٰلِدُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdِlَٰhk", "root": "خلد"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 83, "text": "وَإِذْ أَخَذْنَا مِيثَٰقَ بَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ لَا تَعْبُدُونَ إِلَّا ٱللَّهَ وَبِٱلْوَٰلِدَيْنِ إِحْسَانًا وَذِى ٱلْقُرْبَىٰ وَٱلْيَتَٰمَىٰ وَٱلْمَسَٰكِينِ وَقُولُوا۟ لِلنَّاسِ حُسْنًا وَأَقِيمُوا۟ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ وَءَاتُوا۟ ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ ثُمَّ تَوَلَّيْتُمْ إِلَّا قَلِيلًا مِّنكُمْ وَأَنتُم مُّعْرِضُونَ ", "translation": "And [recall] when We took the covenant from the Children of Israel, [enjoining upon them], \"Do not worship except Allāh; and to parents do good and to relatives, orphans, and the needy. And speak to people good [words] and establish prayer and give zakāh.\" Then you turned away, except a few of you, and you were refusing.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَخَذْنَا", "translit": "āَnْhdَhkَaʾ", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِيثَٰقَ", "translit": "َqَٰhtyِm", "root": "وثق"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "بَنِىٓ", "translit": "ٓàِnَb", "root": "بني"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ", "translit": "َlyِءَٰٓrْsِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "تَعْبُدُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdُbْʿعَt", "root": "عبد"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "ٱللَّهَ", "translit": "َhَّllٱ", "root": "اله"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "وَبِٱلْوَٰلِدَيْنِ", "translit": "ِnْyَdِlَٰwْlٱِbَw", "root": "ولد"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "إِحْسَانًا", "translit": "āًnāَsْḥِiʾ", "root": "حسن"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "وَذِى", "translit": "àِhdَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "ٱلْقُرْبَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَbْrُqْlٱ", "root": "قرب"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "وَٱلْيَتَٰمَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَmَٰtَyْlٱَw", "root": "يتم"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "وَٱلْمَسَٰكِينِ", "translit": "ِnyِkَٰsَmْlٱَw", "root": "سكن"}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "وَقُولُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُlwُqَw", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "لِلنَّاسِ", "translit": "ِsāَّnlِl", "root": "انس"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "حُسْنًا", "translit": "āًnْsُḥ", "root": "حسن"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "وَأَقِيمُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُmyِqَaʾَw", "root": "قوم"}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ", "translit": "َẗٰwَlَّṣlٱ", "root": "صلو"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "وَءَاتُوا۟", "translit": "۟āwُtāَءَw", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ", "translit": "َẗٰwَkَّzlٱ", "root": "زكو"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "تَوَلَّيْتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtْyَّlَwَt", "root": "ولي"}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "إِلَّا", "translit": "āَّlِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "قَلِيلًا", "translit": "āًlyِlَq", "root": "قلل"}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "مِّنكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُknِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 28, "arabic": "وَأَنتُم", "translit": "mُtnَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 29, "arabic": "مُّعْرِضُونَ", "translit": "َnwُḍِrْʿعُّm", "root": "عرض"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 84, "text": "وَإِذْ أَخَذْنَا مِيثَٰقَكُمْ لَا تَسْفِكُونَ دِمَآءَكُمْ وَلَا تُخْرِجُونَ أَنفُسَكُم مِّن دِيَٰرِكُمْ ثُمَّ أَقْرَرْتُمْ وَأَنتُمْ تَشْهَدُونَ ", "translation": "And [recall] when We took your covenant, [saying], \"Do not shed your [i.e., each other's] blood or evict one another from your homes.\" Then you acknowledged [this] while you were witnessing.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَإِذْ", "translit": "ْhdِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَخَذْنَا", "translit": "āَnْhdَhkَaʾ", "root": "اخذ"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِيثَٰقَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَqَٰhtyِm", "root": "وثق"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَا", "translit": "āَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "تَسْفِكُونَ", "translit": "َnwُkِfْsَt", "root": "سفك"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "دِمَآءَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَءٓāَmِd", "root": "دمو"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "تُخْرِجُونَ", "translit": "َnwُjgِrْhkُt", "root": "خرج"}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "أَنفُسَكُم", "translit": "mُkَsُfnَaʾ", "root": "نفس"}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "مِّن", "translit": "nِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "دِيَٰرِكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkِrَٰyِd", "root": "دور"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "أَقْرَرْتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtْrَrْqَaʾ", "root": "قرر"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "وَأَنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnَaʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "تَشْهَدُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdَhْhsَt", "root": "شهد"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 85, "text": "ثُمَّ أَنتُمْ هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ تَقْتُلُونَ أَنفُسَكُمْ وَتُخْرِجُونَ فَرِيقًا مِّنكُم مِّن دِيَٰرِهِمْ تَظَٰهَرُونَ عَلَيْهِم بِٱلْإِثْمِ وَٱلْعُدْوَٰنِ وَإِن يَأْتُوكُمْ أُسَٰرَىٰ تُفَٰدُوهُمْ وَهُوَ مُحَرَّمٌ عَلَيْكُمْ إِخْرَاجُهُمْۚ أَفَتُؤْمِنُونَ بِبَعْضِ ٱلْكِتَٰبِ وَتَكْفُرُونَ بِبَعْضٍۚ فَمَا جَزَآءُ مَن يَفْعَلُ ذَٰلِكَ مِنكُمْ إِلَّا خِزْىٌ فِى ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَاۖ وَيَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ يُرَدُّونَ إِلَىٰٓ أَشَدِّ ٱلْعَذَابِۗ وَمَا ٱللَّهُ بِغَٰفِلٍ عَمَّا تَعْمَلُونَ ", "translation": "Then, you are those [same ones who are] killing one another and evicting a party of your people from their homes, cooperating against them in sin and aggression. And if they come to you as captives, you ransom them, although their eviction was forbidden to you. So do you believe in part of the Scripture and disbelieve in part? Then what is the recompense for those who do that among you except disgrace in worldly life; and on the Day of Resurrection they will be sent back to the severest of punishment. And Allāh is not unaware of what you do.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ثُمَّ", "translit": "َّmُht", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَنتُمْ", "translit": "ْmُtnَaʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ", "translit": "ِءٓāَlُwʾَٰٓh", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "تَقْتُلُونَ", "translit": "َnwُlُtْqَt", "root": "قتل"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "أَنفُسَكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkَsُfnَaʾ", "root": "نفس"}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَتُخْرِجُونَ", "translit": "َnwُjgِrْhkُtَw", "root": "خرج"}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "فَرِيقًا", "translit": "āًqyِrَf", "root": "فرق"}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "مِّنكُم", "translit": "mُknِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "مِّن", "translit": "nِّm", "root": ""}, {"id": 10, "arabic": "دِيَٰرِهِمْ", "translit": "ْmِhِrَٰyِd", "root": "دور"}, {"id": 11, "arabic": "تَظَٰهَرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrَhَٰẓَt", "root": "ظهر"}, {"id": 12, "arabic": "عَلَيْهِم", "translit": "mِhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 13, "arabic": "بِٱلْإِثْمِ", "translit": "ِmْhtِiʾْlٱِb", "root": "اثم"}, {"id": 14, "arabic": "وَٱلْعُدْوَٰنِ", "translit": "ِnَٰwْdُʿعْlٱَw", "root": "عدو"}, {"id": 15, "arabic": "وَإِن", "translit": "nِiʾَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 16, "arabic": "يَأْتُوكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkwُtْaʾَy", "root": "اتي"}, {"id": 17, "arabic": "أُسَٰرَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَrَٰsُaʾ", "root": "اسر"}, {"id": 18, "arabic": "تُفَٰدُوهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhwُdَٰfُt", "root": "فدي"}, {"id": 19, "arabic": "وَهُوَ", "translit": "َwُhَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 20, "arabic": "مُحَرَّمٌ", "translit": "ٌmَّrَḥُm", "root": "حرم"}, {"id": 21, "arabic": "عَلَيْكُمْ", "translit": "ْmُkْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 22, "arabic": "إِخْرَاجُهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhُjgāَrْhkِiʾ", "root": "خرج"}, {"id": 23, "arabic": "أَفَتُؤْمِنُونَ", "translit": "َnwُnِmْwʾُtَfَaʾ", "root": "امن"}, {"id": 24, "arabic": "بِبَعْضِ", "translit": "ِḍْʿعَbِb", "root": "بعض"}, {"id": 25, "arabic": "ٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "translit": "ِbَٰtِkْlٱ", "root": "كتب"}, {"id": 26, "arabic": "وَتَكْفُرُونَ", "translit": "َnwُrُfْkَtَw", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 27, "arabic": "بِبَعْضٍ", "translit": "ٍḍْʿعَbِb", "root": "بعض"}, {"id": 28, "arabic": "ف